# NTNH Server - Git attributes
#
# server.jar and minecraft_server.1.7.10.jar are committed as real files so fresh
# installs never need to download them.
#
# The HBM mod jar is ~112 MB and exceeds GitHub's normal per-file size limit, so
# the repository stores it as an LFS pointer. The launchers materialize it from
# the matching NTNH release archive; users do not need Git LFS.
mods/HBM-*.jar filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
